  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n・{調査|ちょうさ}する (to investigate, to survey)\n・{調査|ちょうさ}を{行|おこな}う (to conduct a survey)\n・{調査|ちょうさ}の{結果|けっか} (survey/investigation results)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUND WORDS:\n・{世論|よろん/せろん}{調査|ちょうさ} (public opinion poll)\n・{市場|しじょう}{調査|ちょうさ} (market research)\n・{実態|じったい}{調査|ちょうさ} (fact-finding survey)\n・{現地|げんち}{調査|ちょうさ} (field survey)\n・{調査|ちょうさ}{報告|ほうこく} (investigation report)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{調査|ちょうさ}: Investigation, survey (formal, systematic)\n・{捜査|そうさ}: Criminal investigation (police work)",
